---
import Button from '../../ui/button/Button.astro'
import Icon from '../../ui/icon/Icon.astro'
---

<div class="wizard-actions">
  <p>К предыдущим шагам можно вернуться без потери ответов.</p>
  <div>
    <button class="wizard-back" type="button" data-wizard-back hidden>
      <Icon name="SolidArrowLeft" class="wizard-action-icon" />
      <span>Назад</span>
    </button>
    <Button type="submit">
      <span data-submit-label>Продолжить</span>{' '}
      <Icon name="SolidArrowRight" class="wizard-action-icon" />
    </Button>
  </div>
</div>
